# Skyknight Squire: "Whenever another creature you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." A token entering counts too:
# Prideful Parent entering gives one counter and the Cat token it creates gives a second, so the Squire is a 3/3 without flying (two
# counters). A Memnite then gives the third and the Squire flies as a Knight, while the Parent (a Cat Beast with vigilance and no counters of its
# own) is untouched.

